  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Income tax expense&#160;was approximately $0.3&#160;million, with effective tax rates of (2.5)% and (1.1)%, respectively, for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively. For each of the years ended December 31, 2025&#160;and 2024, the effective tax rate differs from the statutory rate primarily due to the valuation allowance on our Federal and state net operating losses (NOLs) and net deferred tax assets generated during the year.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
