   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">The following table summarizes the assets and liabilities of the China JV included in our consolidated balance sheets at <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em>, respectively:</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31" name="us-gaap:JointVentureFormationTableTextBlock" id="c3127725" escape="true">
