   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Included in accrued payroll and related costs at <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2024 </em>is approximately $<ix:nonFraction id="c141655654" contextRef="i_2024-12-31_RestructuringCostAndReserveAxis-EmployeeSeveranceMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:EmployeeRelatedLiabilitiesCurrentAndNoncurrent" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">0.4</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million of accrued severance costs for the Company&#8217;s former Executive Vice President.&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
