   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><b>NOTE <em style="font: inherit;">18.</em> </b>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;<b>STOCK OPTIONS</b>&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
